<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling weakens slightly against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling weakens slightly against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened slightly against the dollar on Monday and strengthened against the pound, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling traded at a mean rate of 598.3965 compared with 598.0689 on Friday. Against the pound, it traded at a mean rate of 957.04052 compared with 963.7911 on Friday.</p>
</text>
